licensed under the MIT License:

Permission is hereby granted, free of charge, to any person obtaining a copy of
the Public API Files to use, copy, include, compile against, and distribute
those specific interface files within their own third-party mods, subject to
retaining the copyright notice in those files. This exception applies ONLY to
the Public API Files and does not extend to any other file in this repository.

